    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20526" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βου-θῠτέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slay</i> or <i>sacrifice oxen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				888
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				785
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				362c
			</span></i>, etc.: also in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				32.15.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				42.28
			</span></i>, al.: generally, <i>sacrifice, slaughter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ὗν καὶ τράγον καὶ κριόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					819
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς θυσίας τὰς καθηκούσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					2.594.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ Ἀπόλλωνι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				12(7).389.16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1021.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>.</div>
